# AUD-002 fixture: a triangle face (npolys==3, tinyobjloader's fast
# triangulate=true path) referencing a vertex index far beyond the vertex
# count. tinyobjloader's out-of-range guards protect only the quad/polygon
# triangulation paths, not this one -- it previously reached mc3togltf's
# loadObjMesh() and was subscripted into attrib.vertices with no bounds
# check (an out-of-bounds read). Must now be rejected with a clear error.
v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0

f 1 2 9999
